<doc id="170008" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=170008" title="Valve Corporation">
Valve Corporation

Valve Corporation, uga dikenal minangka Valve Software utawa mung gampang Valve, yaiku pangembang game video, penerbit, lan distribusi digital Amerika sing dadi kantor pusat ing &lt;a href="Bellevue"&gt;Bellevue&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Washington%2C%20D.C."&gt;Washington&lt;/a&gt;. Pangembang platform distribusi piranti lunak &lt;a href="Steam"&gt;Steam&lt;/a&gt; lan Half-Life, Counter-Strike, Portal, Day of Defeat, Team Fortress, Left 4 Dead, lan &lt;a href="Dota%202"&gt;Dota&lt;/a&gt; seri.
Valve didegake ing taun 1996 dening tilas karyawan Microsoft &lt;a href="Gabe%20Newell"&gt;Gabe Newell&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Mike%20Harrington"&gt;Mike Harrington&lt;/a&gt;. Produk debut sing pertama, PC penembak Half-Life PC pisanan, dirilis ing taun 1998 kanggo ngakoni kritik lan sukses komersial, sawise iku Harrington metu saka perusahaan kasebut. Ing taun 2003, Valve ngluncurake Steam, sing kira-kira setengah saka penjualan game PC digital ing taun 2011. Miturut taun 2012, Valve makarya sekitar 250 wong lan dilaporake luwih saka US $ 3 milyar, dadi perusahaan sing paling nguntungake saben karyawan ing Amerika Serikat. Ing taun 2010, Valve wiwit ngembangake hardware, kaya ta &lt;a href="Steam%20Machine"&gt;Steam Machine&lt;/a&gt;, merek PC game, uga headset realita virtual Samsung Vive lan Valve Index.
