<doc id="170113" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=170113" title="Niccolò Zingarelli">
Niccolò Zingarelli

Niccolò Antonio Zingarelli utawa ditepungi mawa Nicola Antonio Zingarelli (&lt;a href="4%20April"&gt;4 April&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1752"&gt;1752&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Napoli"&gt;Napoli&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="5%20Mei"&gt;5 Mei&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1837"&gt;1837&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Torre%20del%20Greco"&gt;Torre del Greco&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Karajan%20rong%20Sisilia"&gt;Karajan rong Sisilia&lt;/a&gt;) iku komponis Italia lan wakil saka apa sing diarani &lt;a href="Sekolah%20Neapoli"&gt;Sekolah Neapoli&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Babad slira</h2>
Babad slira.
Zingarelli olèh pawiyatané ing Konsèrvatorium Gréja Madonna di Loreto ing Napoli bawahané &lt;a href="Fedele%20Fenaroli"&gt;Fedele Fenaroli&lt;/a&gt; lan sawisé iku uga saka Abbate &lt;a href="Alessandro%20Speranza"&gt;Alessandro Speranza&lt;/a&gt;, siswané &lt;a href="Francesco%20Durante"&gt;Francesco Durante&lt;/a&gt;.
Ing taun 1779 dhèwèké début ing &lt;a href="T%C3%A9ater%20San%20Carlo"&gt;Téater San Carlo&lt;/a&gt; karo &lt;a href="Opera"&gt;Opera&lt;/a&gt; Montezuma, sing ing taun-taun sawisé iku bakal dadi opera sing kerep digelar lan diaprésiasi wong akèh. 

