<doc id="170322" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=170322" title="Stewart Downing">
Stewart Downing

Stewart Downing yaiku salah sawijining pamain &lt;a href="bal-balan"&gt;bal-balan&lt;/a&gt; aguna saka nagara &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt; kang main kanggo klub &lt;a href="Blackburn%20Rovers%20F.C."&gt;Blackburn Rovers&lt;/a&gt;. Downing lair ing kutha &lt;a href="Middlesbrough"&gt;Middlesbrough&lt;/a&gt; surya ping 22 &lt;a href="Juli"&gt;Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1984"&gt;1984&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké duwé dedeg 180 &lt;a href="cm"&gt;cm&lt;/a&gt; lan migunakaké &lt;a href="sikil"&gt;sikil&lt;/a&gt; kiwa minangka sikil utamané kanggo main bal.Downing yaiku pamain kang manggon ana posisi suwiwi kiwa utawa tengen gumantung kabutuhan formasi, mokal yèn dhèwèké pamain asikil kiwa kaya &lt;a href="Arjen%20Robben"&gt;Arjen Robben&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Gareth%20Bale"&gt;Gareth Bale&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Suso"&gt;Suso&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Lionel%20Messi"&gt;Lionel Messi&lt;/a&gt;.
Downing lulus saka akadhemi Middlesbrough lan nglakoni dhebut &lt;a href="Piala%20FA"&gt;Piala FA&lt;/a&gt; surya 24 &lt;a href="April"&gt;April&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2002"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt; lumawan &lt;a href="Ipswich%20Town"&gt;Ipswich Town&lt;/a&gt;. Taun &lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt; dhèwèké disilihaké menyang &lt;a href="Sunderland%20A.F.C."&gt;Sunderland&lt;/a&gt; kanggo ngundhakaké kaprigelan bal-balan. Mangsa &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;-05 Downing nyathetaké 49 panampilan, nyithak enem &lt;a href="gol"&gt;gol&lt;/a&gt; lan ngirim pirang-pirang asis. Ing &lt;a href="Jendela"&gt;cendhéla&lt;/a&gt; transfer taun &lt;a href="2009"&gt;2009&lt;/a&gt; dhèwèké dituku klub &lt;a href="Aston%20Villa%20F.C."&gt;Aston Villa&lt;/a&gt; kanthi rega 10 yuta &lt;a href="Pound%20sterling"&gt;Poundsterling&lt;/a&gt; tambah bonus rong yuta poundsterling yèn panampilané kalebu becik. Downing alihan menyang &lt;a href="Liverpool%20F.C."&gt;Liverpool&lt;/a&gt; surya 15 Juli &lt;a href="2011"&gt;2011&lt;/a&gt; kanthi rega kira-kira 20 yuta poundsterling lan nglakoni dhebut &lt;a href="Liga%20Primer%20Inggris"&gt;Liga Primèr Inggris&lt;/a&gt; sepisan kanggo Liverpool mangsa 2011-12. Downing nyithak gol sepisané kanggo Liverpool ing mangsa candhaké, yaiku nalika kuwalifikasi &lt;a href="Liga%20Eropah%20UEFA"&gt;Liga Europa&lt;/a&gt; lumawan &lt;a href="FC%20Gomel"&gt;FC Gomel&lt;/a&gt; ing stadhion &lt;a href="Anfield"&gt;Anfield&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèké uga nyithak siji-sijiné gol kamenangan lumawan klub saka &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Anzhi%20Makhachkala"&gt;Anzhi Makhachkala&lt;/a&gt;.
