<doc id="170331" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=170331" title="Kolach">
Kolach

Kolach (uga dieja kolache, kolace utawa kolacky, saka kolokolčan &lt;a href="Basa%20C%C3%A9ko"&gt;Czech&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Basa%20Slowak"&gt;Slovak&lt;/a&gt;, sg. koláč) minangka sawijining jinis pastri sing nduwèni bagéan isen woh sing dikelilingi adonan puffy.
<h2>Perayaan Kolache</h2>
Perayaan Kolache.
