Lahoh

 Lahoh, uga Luḥūḥ (&lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt;: لحوح‎‎, &lt;a href="basa%20Somali"&gt;Somali&lt;/a&gt;: Laxoox, #ALIH‎
