<doc id="170540" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=170540" title="Dinuguan">
Dinuguan

 Dinuguan (]) iku olahan &lt;a href="Pilipina"&gt;Filipino&lt;/a&gt; gurih &lt;a href="godhogan"&gt;godhogan&lt;/a&gt; biasane saka daging babi jeroan (biasane paru, ginjel, usus, kuping, ati lan moncong) lan / utawa daging simmered ing sugih, pedhes peteng duduh saka babi getih, &lt;a href="Bawang"&gt;papak&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lombok%20abang"&gt;chili&lt;/a&gt; (paling asring siling haba), lan cuka. 
