<doc id="170606" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=170606" title="Céviché">
Céviché

 Ceviche, uga cebiche, seviche, utawa sebiche biasane digawé saka iwak seger mentah nambani ing jus seger jeuk, paling umum &lt;a href="L%C3%A9mon"&gt;linglang&lt;/a&gt; utawa jeruk, lan karo Aji, &lt;a href="Lombok%20abang"&gt;chili mrico&lt;/a&gt; utawa bumbu liyane kalebu bawang disigar, uyah, lan &lt;a href="ketumbar"&gt;ketumbar&lt;/a&gt;.
