Kokorètsi

 Kokoretsi (basa, &lt;a href="Basa%20Grikenlan"&gt;Grikenlan&lt;/a&gt;: κοκορέτσι, &lt;a href="basa%20Basa%20Turki"&gt;Basa Turki&lt;/a&gt;: kokoreç) Yaiku panganan saka Balkan lan &lt;a href="Anatolia"&gt;Asia Minor&lt;/a&gt;, dumadi saka domba utawa wedhus usus mbungkus pengalamane jeroan, kalebu roti, &lt;a href="Jantung"&gt;ati&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="paru-paru"&gt;paru-paru&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="ginjel"&gt;ginjel&lt;/a&gt;, lan biasane panggang; jinis kalebu njero cincang sing dimasak ing wajan. Usus domba sing nyedhot luwih disenengi.

