<doc id="170954" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=170954" title="Gedhung Capitol">
Gedhung Capitol

Capitol &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Basa%20Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt;: United States Capitol) yaiku gedhong &lt;a href="kapitol"&gt;kapitol&lt;/a&gt; sing digunakake dadi kantor &lt;a href="Konggr%C3%A8s%20Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Konggrès Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;. Bangunan kasebut dununge ana ing &lt;a href="Washington%2C%20D.C."&gt;Washington, DC&lt;/a&gt;, ing pucuk Capitol Hill. Sanajan ora ana ing tengah-tengah &lt;a href="Washington%2C%20D.C."&gt;Distrik Columbia&lt;/a&gt;, Capitol dadi fokus ngendi pamukiman-pamukiman ing wilayah kasebut didum.
Capitol asline dirancang dening William Thornton. Banjur Capitol diowahi dening &lt;a href="Stephen%20Hallet"&gt;Stephen Hallet&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Benjamin%20Latrobe"&gt;Benjamin Latrobe&lt;/a&gt; lan banjur &lt;a href="Charles%20Bulfinch"&gt;Charles Bulfinch&lt;/a&gt;. Kubah lan sayap saiki &lt;a href="Dewan%20Perwakilan%20Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Dewan Perwakilan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Senat%20Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Senat&lt;/a&gt; dirancang dening &lt;a href="Thomas%20U.%20Walter"&gt;Thomas U. Walter&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="August%20Schoenborn"&gt;August Schoenborn&lt;/a&gt;, lan disiapake ing ngisor mandhor &lt;a href="Edward%20Clark"&gt;Edward Clark&lt;/a&gt;. 
&lt;a href="Reca"&gt;Reca&lt;/a&gt; sing ana ing sisih dununge kubah bangunan iki yaiku &lt;a href="Reca%20Kamardikan"&gt;Reca Kamardikan&lt;/a&gt; (Statue of Freedom).
Ing taun 2007, gedhong Capitol iki wis entuk &lt;a href="nomer%20enem%20ing%20arsitektur%20favorit%20Amerika"&gt;nomer enem ing arsitektur favorit Amerika&lt;/a&gt; dening &lt;a href="Institut%20Arsitek%20Am%C3%A9rika"&gt;Institut Arsitek Amérika&lt;/a&gt;.
