<doc id="170982" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=170982" title="Malasada">
Malasada

Malasada (basa #ALIH, from " &lt;a href="wiktionary%3Amal%23Portuguese"&gt;mal&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="wiktionary%3Apt%3Aassada%23Portugu%C3%AAs"&gt;assada&lt;/a&gt; " = "under-masak") (padha karo filhós)  yaiku gula ing basa &lt;a href="Portegal"&gt;Portugis&lt;/a&gt;. Yaiku jinis donat goreng, digawe saka bal adonan &lt;a href="Khamir"&gt;ragi cilik&lt;/a&gt; lan dilapisi karo gula pasir lan kadang kala uga kayu manis. Malasada Portugis tradisional ora ngemot bolongan utawa jinis pengisi, nanging sawetara jinis kalebu, utamane sing digawe ing &lt;a href="Hawaii"&gt;Hawaii&lt;/a&gt;. Malasada asring dipangan ing &lt;a href="Mardi%20Gras"&gt;Mardi Gras&lt;/a&gt; - dina sadurunge dina &lt;a href="Rebo%20Awu"&gt;Rebo&lt;/a&gt;.

