<doc id="171019" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=171019" title="Pączki">
Pączki

Pączki (,]&lt;a href="null"&gt;pra=|Babagan swara iki&lt;/a&gt; ; tunggal: pączek] ; Kashubian ; Silesian ; Silesian) yaiku &lt;a href="Dhonat"&gt;donat&lt;/a&gt; sing diisi sing ditemokake ing masakan Polandia.
Pączki sing diolah &lt;a href="Gor%C3%A8ng%20kungkum"&gt;jero-goreng&lt;/a&gt; bagéyan &lt;a href="adhonan"&gt;adhonan&lt;/a&gt; maujud menyang lingkungan lan kapenuhan confiture utawa Isi manis liyane. Pączki biasane sidik gula powdered, kebentuk, glaze utawa bit pepe &lt;a href="Jeruk"&gt;orange&lt;/a&gt; zest. Alkohol alkohol sithik (roh sing wis ditrapake sacara tradisional) ditambahake ing adonan sadurunge masak; nalika nguap, ngalangi panyerepan minyak ing adonan. Pączki umume dianggep alus nanging rada ambruk, kanthi garis sing padhang; fitur-fitur kasebut katon minangka bukti yen adonan digoreng lenga seger. 

