<doc id="171020" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=171020" title="Temblèque">
Temblèque

Tembleque minangka panganan cuci mulut panganan penutup saka klapa saka &lt;a href="Puerto%20Rico"&gt;Puerto Rico&lt;/a&gt;. Iki minangka salah sawijining panganan cuci mulut sing paling populer ing masakan Puerto Rico. 
<h2>Bahan-bahan</h2>
Bahan-bahan.
is Temblequemade by cooking coconut milk, heavy cream (optional), salt, cornstarch, cinnamon, and sugar. Recipes may include spices such as &lt;a href="Cengk%C3%A8h"&gt;cloves&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Panili"&gt;vanilla&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href="Pala"&gt;nutmeg&lt;/a&gt; or extra flavoring such as &lt;a href="Rum%20%28unjukan%20mawi%20alkohol%29"&gt;rum&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Banyu%20kembang%20jeruk"&gt;orange blossom water&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="Coco%20L%C3%B3pez"&gt;cream of coconut&lt;/a&gt;, or may be garnished with &lt;a href="Godhong%20Mint"&gt;mint&lt;/a&gt;, almonds, fruit, &lt;a href="Sirup%20rasa"&gt;flavored syrup&lt;/a&gt; or chocolate shavings.
Ing basa Spanyol, tembung tembleque minangka tembung sifat sing digunakake kanggo njlentrehake bab sing goyang utawa tembung aran, kanggo nggambarake awake dhewe. Panganan panganan cuci mulut, amarga gaya Jell-O- kaya, tekstur gel geter, nggeter, goyang, lan panganan cuci mulut sing wis rampung, yen disiyapake kanthi bener. 
