<doc id="171021" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=171021" title="Canjica">
Canjica

☃Canjica☃ (Portuguese pronunciation: [kɐ̃ˈʒikɐ]), ☃☃ ([muɡũˈza]) utawa ☃☃ ([mũɡũˈza]) minangka panganan legi saka &lt;a href="Brasil"&gt;Brasil&lt;/a&gt;, digandhengake karo festival musim salju, sing ing Brasil wulan Juni (Festa Junina). 
