<doc id="171118" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=171118" title="Stroganoff sapi">
Stroganoff sapi

Daging sapi Stroganoff utawa daging sapi Stroganov (basa &lt;a href="basa%20Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;: бефстроганов, befstróganov) minangka &lt;a href="Masakan%20Ruslan"&gt;sajian&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi sing&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kangkung%20cah%20trasi"&gt;diiris&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Masakan%20Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan sing&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kangkung%20cah%20trasi"&gt;disajik&lt;/a&gt; ing saus nganggo smetana (&lt;a href="krim%20asem"&gt;krim asem&lt;/a&gt;). Saka asale ing pertengahan abad kaping-19 Ruslan, iki wis misuwur ing saindenging jagad, kanthi jinis sing beda saka resep asline.
